```mdl
verdict F-5.1: Summarize fetches via the CRX render-proxy with EDGE fallback, extracts text, generates markdown and stores a Text.
  status: untested
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-bookmarks/src/types/BookmarkOperation.ts#Summarize, github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-bookmarks/src/util/fetch-page.ts#fetchPage, github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-bookmarks/src/util/extract-readable-text.ts#extractReadableText, github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-bookmarks/src/operations/summarize.ts]
  walkthrough:
    - The operation declares a Bookmark ref in and a Text ref out. github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-bookmarks/src/types/BookmarkOperation.ts#Summarize
    - fetchPage tries the extension render-proxy and falls back to the EDGE CORS proxy. github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-bookmarks/src/util/fetch-page.ts#fetchPage
    - extractReadableText strips markup to plain text. github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-bookmarks/src/util/extract-readable-text.ts#extractReadableText
    - The handler runs an AiRequest, adds a Text with the reply and returns its ref. github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-bookmarks/src/operations/summarize.ts
  note: Only `extractReadableText` has a test; the operation and `fetchPage` are not exercised.
```

